  "subject": "a father blowing up fifty balloons by mouth the night before his daughter's sixth birthday because he forgot to buy a pump, getting dizzier with every one",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien merengue típico, Dominican perico ripiao style. Fast diatonic button accordion runs; a tambora drum slapping the two-beat; a metal güira scraping steady eighths; a saxophone answering riff; a bouncing electric bass. Tight, bright, dry live band sound. An energetic male tenor with out-of-breath comic delivery, a small group shouting on the chorus. 150 BPM, C major. Breathless, frantic and funny. No reggaeton dembow, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no ballad strings.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n明仔載是 查某囝生日\n伊講欲愛 五十粒\n我歸工攏 無閒甲\n打氣機 煞袂記得買\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n無要緊 爸爸有喙\n一粒仔 歕予伊飽\n\n[Chorus]\n歕 歕 歕 雞胿仔\n一粒紅 一粒青\n頭殼眩 目睭花\n閣歕一粒 就好\n\n[Verse]\n十粒過去 喙顊仔痠\n二十粒 胸坎咧喘\n貓仔驚甲 走去覕\n某佇邊仔 笑甲倒\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n無要緊 爸爸有喙\n喘一下氣 閣繼續歕\n\n[Chorus]\n歕 歕 歕 雞胿仔\n一粒黃 一粒白\n厝內一半 予我歕滿\n閣歕一粒 就好\n\n[Verse]\n半暝三點 最後一粒\n伊煞 碰一聲破去\n我坐塗跤 煞笑出來\n\n[Bridge]\n早起囡仔 門一下開\n伊講爸爸 你哪會遮厲害\n\n[Chorus]\n歕 歕 歕 雞胿仔\n四十九粒 嘛真好\n頭殼眩 心肝甜\n明年 我先買機器\n\n[Chorus]\n歕 歕 歕 雞胿仔\n四十九粒 嘛真好\n頭殼眩 心肝甜\n明年 我先買機器\n\n[Outro]\n生日快樂 雞胿仔滿規廳",
